"An impending storm looms overhead, filling you with a deep sense of unease." 
"Dark clouds swirl with ominous energy as desperation grips you, pushing you" 
"to search for shelter from the coming tempest."
"****"
"But luck is not on your side today. The skies unleash their fury, sending" 
"torrential rain crashing down. Every droplet soaks straight through your" 
"clothes, making the wet fabric cling to your skin and chilling you to the bone."   
"****"
"With every step, your boots squelch in the mud. The cold sinks deep into" 
"your frame, sending shivers through your body as you force yourself forward" 
"against the harsh elements, your teeth chattering and muscles aching. (-1 HP)"
""
